{
  "_about": "Capture eval phrases. 'expect' is what the pipeline should produce; 'mock' is what an ideal model returns, used by the unit test. Dates: today = 2026-11-04 (Wednesday). Events also have 'end' (HH:MM) and 'location'. due: 'today' | 'tomorrow' | '+N' days | 'YYYY-MM-DD' | null.",
